---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide. Learn how we handle your data, cookies, and third-party services on our independent travel guide website."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-3">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-warm-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-warm-500">Last updated: July 31, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-warm-700 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide (<em>dujiangyan-panda-base.com</em>) is a static informational website. We do not use cookies, tracking scripts, or analytics services that collect personal data. We do not have user accounts, comment systems, or newsletter signup forms.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The only personal data we may receive is when you voluntarily contact us via email. In that case, we receive your email address and any information you choose to include in your message.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Any information you provide via email is used solely to respond to your inquiry. We do not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties</li>
          <li>Use your information for marketing purposes</li>
          <li>Add your email to any mailing list</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">3. Hosting & Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect basic technical data (such as IP addresses and request logs) as part of its standard web hosting operations. This data is governed by Cloudflare's privacy policy.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Some pages contain outbound links to third-party websites (e.g., Trip.com, official panda base websites, travel agencies). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">4. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is a general-audience travel guide. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-warm-900 mb-3">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">hello@dujiangyan-panda-base.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
